bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27, 0, "Rust seed native codegen evaluates a value-producing inline if/else whose else arm is a short-circuit or/and chain to false (observed in ladder run 45916738302 rung 2 hello build blocking worker reap with sealed=-1). Source workaround converts the expression to plain statements in shard_worker_reaped_stopped_v1 at src/app/cli/shard_worker_reap_v1.spl:217-229; Rust seed native codegen fix remains open."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27, P1, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "Seed native codegen: inline if/else whose else arm is an or/and chain evaluates false", src/app/cli/shard_worker_reap_v1.spl, 217, doc/08_tracking/bug/seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27.md, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27 w6-3: registered orphan @workaround tag at src/app/cli/shard_worker_reap_v1.spl:217-229 (shard_worker_reaped_stopped_v1); test/01_unit/app/cli/shard_worker_reap_spec.spl exists on release/1.0.0 (not checked out in this sparse worktree, and interpreter passes the inline form); status=open pending Rust seed native lowering fix and @workaround retirement."
    seed_native_inline_if_else_or_chain_false_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-28: real cause is the import ABI, not if/else lowering: C bool rt_process_is_running was imported with an I64 return and the caller read undefined RAX bits. Fixed by f63e2e35906d + PR 12278 (d4f41864e4a, runtime_h_bool_returns_use_i8_abi guard). @workaround stays until a Linux seed redeploy passes ladder rung 2 natively."
